tion metrics and experiment different kinds of methods, including weighted loss, data augmentation, transfer learning, and U-Net architecture. Weighted loss method achieved 61.07% average IoU and data augmentation method with rotated and cropped images achieved 63.73% IoU. However, it largely increases the training time. Using the transfer learning VGG, we achieve 73.74% average pixel accuracy and 58.45% average IoU on the test set. In addition, we achieve 78.03% average test pixel accuracy and 64.04% average test IoU by the method of U-Net. Finally, we build a new model named Mobile-Deeplabv3+, and we achieved 83.56% average pixel accuracy and 71.35% average IoU on the test set.","topics":[],"score":289441,"global_rank":27239,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5610},{"name":"smfxfc/FighterFactBot","owner":"smfxfc","html_url":"https://github.com/smfxfc/FighterFactBot","stars":3,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Reddit bot to deliver MMA fighter stats when called by a user. ","topics":[],"score":289438,"global_rank":27240,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5611},{"name":"mgottein/github-doc","owner":"mgottein","html_url":"https://github.com/mgottein/github-doc","stars":11,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":289433,"global_rank":27242,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5612},{"name":"redwardstern/sublime-a-file-icon","owner":"redwardstern","html_url":"https://github.com/redwardstern/sublime-a-file-icon","stars":2,"forks":4,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A File Icon package for Sublime Text 3","topics":[],"score":289408,"global_rank":27256,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":5613},{"name":"w-guo/Boeing-automated-tow-end-inspection","owner":"w-guo","html_url":"https://github.com/w-guo/Boeing-automated-tow-end-inspection","stars":2,"forks":2,"watchers":2,"issues":2,"language":"Python","description":"Improve